# Database snapshots, which live beside the database itself. Anchored with a
# leading slash: written as "backups/" it matched every directory of that name
# anywhere in the tree, and silently swallowed src/app/api/admin/backups — the
# routes were committed as nothing, built as nothing, and deployed as a UI
# whose endpoints returned 404.
/data/backups/
/prisma/backups/

